+
+	LXVW4X (INP)(R0), VS59
+	LXVW4X (INP)(R8), VS60
+	LXVW4X (INP)(R9), VS61
+	LXVW4X (INP)(R10), VS62
+
+	VXOR V27, V0, V27
+	VXOR V28, V4, V28
