+	SHRQ  $0x02, R8
+	ADDQ  R13, R10
+	ADCQ  R14, R11
+	ADCQ  $0x00, R12
+	ADDQ  R15, R10
+	ADCQ  R8, R11
+	ADCQ  $0x00, R12
